","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106911#issuecomment-2921635582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106911","id":2921635582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uJJ7-","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T08:42:00Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T08:43:25Z","body":"You should rebase your PR in order to squash all your commits into a single one.\r\n\r\nThe way I'd do it:\r\n\r\n- `git log` and find the commit right before your first one\r\n- copy the commit hash of the commit before your first one\r\n- `git rebase -i <commit hash>` this will open a prompt with the commits you want to squash\r\n- delete \"pick\" and write \"squash\" for all commits except your first one\r\n- edit your commit mesage to reflect the change\r\n- force push to your branch\r\n\r\n**Be careful, there's a chance of losing work if done wrong**\r\n\r\nRefer to our doc here: https://thoughtbot.com/blog/git-interactive-rebase-squash-amend-rewriting-history","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine